      "writtenOn": "2023-12-14T08:19:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t have a concrete idea neither. I just appended previous prefix `android,pvmfw` to your initial proposal `target`.\n\nWhat about `android,avf,device` if you\u0027re looking for other name? Here\u0027s my reasons:\n  - The node is also used for unprotected VM where pvmfw isn\u0027t involved. It may be better to drop `pvmfw` but still need distinctive name.\n  - `device` seems better fit compared to `target`, `virtual`, `overlay`, `assigned`, ...\n  \nWDYT? I would defer submitting this CL so we can finalize new VM DTBO format.",
